[{"id":"m_660f8c54beb8da2ee58f","expressionId":"x_4c1666c3ad86a2d7e18f","language":"ja","text":"『居間』","source":"DiQt"},{"id":"m_1bfc3606c29c0ea6a419","expressionId":"x_26869f79615bd71cd6c5","language":"ja","text":"目覚まし時計","source":"DiQt"},{"id":"m_8d82d96f348bf1706fe0","expressionId":"x_e6b059404156ab735d5c","language":"ja","text":"駐車場 (=parking lot)","source":"DiQt"},{"id":"m_4dbe24d78862e0559e66","expressionId":"x_1b836d86806e16bd4516","language":"ja","text":"ファーストネーム,名(「姓」に対する「名」に当たる;米国ではChristian nameという代わりにfirst nameのほうを好んで用いる)","source":"DiQt"},{"id":"m_158fbf52b352029388a0","expressionId":"x_e032efc5972130b22c1c","language":"ja","text":"スポーツセンター, スポーツ施設","source":"DiQt"},{"id":"m_298f4baadea3ab41fbf5","expressionId":"x_34d7399635770491c739","language":"ja","text":"〈C〉信号機","source":"DiQt"},{"id":"m_b84971ba9ef99dd82066","expressionId":"x_21f471a9fe3358c05249","language":"ja","text":"(室内の)空気調節,冷暖房","source":"DiQt"},{"id":"m_4f22c3d17f5534943105","expressionId":"x_b0906cfc570ac318b06f","language":"ja","text":"=disk jockey","source":"DiQt"},{"id":"m_196a1ec11e08f15e8d14","expressionId":"x_d9dd1f4f1dbc459936fb","language":"ja","text":"(…に)面と向かって,直面して《+『with』+『名』》","source":"DiQt"},{"id":"m_b925c88773dedc902fa6","expressionId":"x_53caff60ffea4fc7bc9b","language":"ja","text":"濃紺[色]の","source":"DiQt"},{"id":"m_e9bb5c0c424cc32826c4","expressionId":"x_edddcb03be6ea4e9bab5","language":"ja","text":"《the ~》(文法で)第三人称(he,she,they,a dog,these houses など)","source":"DiQt"},{"id":"m_d5ad3a3d7d7ba6e3399d","expressionId":"x_02de5e45dbaa120427b8","language":"ja","text":"を指摘する","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_eed5aca8d0cc301e4ae5","expressionId":"x_bcfea9f848bc62a0d996","language":"ja","text":"をやめる,を放棄する,を諦める","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_fef12bbfd5fdf9a201cd","expressionId":"x_85d958e563aac57de21b","language":"ja","text":"を持ち出す / を育てる","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_ba86f1546222ad2e3c2a","expressionId":"x_a901e4a887058f50b595","language":"ja","text":"【句動】（椅子に）深く座る,腰掛ける / 《くだけて》のんびりする, 何もしないでいる","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_b6bbe0f40b55f017be48","expressionId":"x_05a4f44d226407e00418","language":"ja","text":"【句動】却下する,否決する / を捨てる,を処分する / 《...から》追い出す,放り出す《of ...》","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_9b3e4134fa811d6d5733","expressionId":"x_7de1bffb13df494fefdf","language":"ja","text":"【句動】を大声で呼ぶ,を呼びかける","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_c18ce244f5b27c011464","expressionId":"x_4dfbee4af4d5d7fc6805","language":"ja","text":"...をもたらす, ...を引き起こす","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_0ba007c27e6fd4d5d0af","expressionId":"x_0ef8e24130d951a0d90f","language":"ja","text":"【句動】を掃除する,をきれいにする,を片付ける / を一掃する,を根絶する","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_47bd316605c83e2d70f6","expressionId":"x_ec7489a74907ece07a6d","language":"ja","text":"【句動】《...に》うまく届く,をうまく送り届ける《to ...》 / 《...に》（困難だが）なんとか理解される《to ...》,《Bに》Aをなんとか理解させる《A through to B》/ 《...に》連絡がつく《to ...》/ （困難など）を乗り越える","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_287c0df6fe7b760d45e8","expressionId":"x_0da2689281f33e348041","language":"ja","text":"《...に》行く,出発する, 立ち去る《to ...》 / 急に大きな音が鳴る, 急に発光する / 爆発する, （銃が）発射される / 急に始める","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_b5545fae82cfdb3aefe5","expressionId":"x_b15f21a63b2461da5910","language":"ja","text":"【句動】...を置く / ...を鎮圧する, ...を鎮める","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_9efc12f871eca840ed14","expressionId":"x_9806598025dcf0a899fe","language":"ja","text":"【句動】（寝た姿勢から）身体を起こす,きちんと座る,（寝ないで）起きている","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_5e6ac33a175c921d4a97","expressionId":"x_5e8a23b1e81023c15a4a","language":"ja","text":"【句動】（書類の空所など）に書き入れる,に記入する","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_48cea33579a36eb3c871","expressionId":"x_4d462926fa665796f299","language":"ja","text":"接) ...であるけれども / ...にもかかわらず / たとえ...としても","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_29fc3fc46e7b3c0d2bbe","expressionId":"x_03489147299f6c772a70","language":"ja","text":"【接】…の限りでは / …と同じ距離まで / 《~ ... goes》...に関する限りでは /【前】（ある場所･程度）まで","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_8c15f963f5d83c7a8447","expressionId":"x_b9031f327a7149e258a3","language":"ja","text":"…する限りにおいて","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_cbd6767f53c406838067","expressionId":"x_1204540e5e31f594be55","language":"ja","text":"（昔と比較して）このごろは, 近ごろは, 最近は","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_0abf287808ef844a8e5b","expressionId":"x_57677d7f66dd8269035b","language":"ja","text":"を心に留める, を肝に銘じる, を忘れない, を念頭に置く([[take something to heart]]) / ...であると考えておく《that ...》","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_b5d0c4af4b3fe1cffe1b","expressionId":"x_c19dcdf3a36f63fe74e8","language":"ja","text":"ある意味では","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_b0bf46f7562625e98a4a","expressionId":"x_5a70859d6bc1a50b400f","language":"ja","text":"...する度合い, ...する程度","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_6c8154637e35fbff700a","expressionId":"x_61f85d42feefe007051b","language":"ja","text":"（支払などの）全額で / 完全に, 完全な形で,まんべんなく","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_b891acab78ec190d3866","expressionId":"x_deb6bfb9e35405991d97","language":"ja","text":"もう少し, もうちょっと","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_7837cea51b60b617531f","expressionId":"x_7c5a5cab60f898c183ae","language":"ja","text":"【熟語】進む、進路を取る","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_29266fa7fda8a4d940e1","expressionId":"x_084a0a2a31690697c88a","language":"ja","text":"その間にも, そうしているうちに / それまでの間は / さて話は変わって, ところで","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_6d58c69d603b932934a7","expressionId":"x_7d843341d5813857f007","language":"ja","text":"（略語などが）...を表す / を象徴する / 《話》《通例否定・疑問文で》...を我慢する / ...に立候補する","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_da98742cc742f7c84e1a","expressionId":"x_9e42322e34f996607d8b","language":"ja","text":"自己の権利によって / 自分自身の能力で, 独立して / 生得の権利で, 生まれながらの","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_3c1d32bcb5718f8d555e","expressionId":"x_a2c8bc5a8e53f4350716","language":"ja","text":"...の代わりに, ...ではなくて, ...どころか","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_683d113bc8f5ed85028e","expressionId":"x_8fabd7e1bc5d3ff11d46","language":"ja","text":"要約すると, 手短に言うと, 詰まるところ","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_388dc01d18c9f03c9cff","expressionId":"x_2c9d690e5b87419c403c","language":"ja","text":"《...に》基づいて《of ...》 / ...ということに基づいて, ...という前提で《that ...》","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_5494d6a5f239afd2b8f5","expressionId":"x_6cfc77f63cc552a92614","language":"ja","text":"《be ~》...する資格がある, ...する権利がある / ...を得る資格がある, ...を得る権利がある","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_27046c7589194cd6aca9","expressionId":"x_a87837bf009f76e210d7","language":"ja","text":"...を考慮して, ...を念頭に置いて / 《have ~ 》...を考えている, ...を計画している, ...の心当たりがある","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_b1ab20a34b97f0113e35","expressionId":"x_6c9e281b522154b0132a","language":"ja","text":"《be ~ ...》〈人・物・事〉が原因で, ...のせいで, ...のために / …に支払われるべき / …する予定","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_4b089a6ae8bf2566da57","expressionId":"x_96a52c3419e59d9481b6","language":"ja","text":"《be ~》今すぐ...をする, まさに...をしようとする","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_4c3b8ab886c1f5a33a47","expressionId":"x_b508090a3df22782ed29","language":"ja","text":"（うわさで）…らしい, ...ということだ, ...だってさ《that ...》","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_c4a26315f978b6b68c93","expressionId":"x_54bcb993445ff5dc334f","language":"ja","text":"...か何か","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_46a77f788a16741b7d26","expressionId":"x_ea3ccbce3904f0771486","language":"ja","text":"《かたく》...の間に, ...のうちに, ...の途上で, ...の過程で","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_c806b779c14e30f32640","expressionId":"x_de90c63738c76ddf7da5","language":"ja","text":"（会・活動など）に参加する","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_3fcad9958116d0e70c0c","expressionId":"x_227c7024de86036c01f8","language":"ja","text":"《名詞の後で》未来の, この先に来る","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_abdb3b93c9da397c91dc","expressionId":"x_1542ec83afb71668151c","language":"ja","text":"（人･物･事）のようなもの, ...によく似たもの, ちょっと...のような / およそ（数量など）,約..., だいたい... / 大した..., すてきな...","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_0580e3d8d69846c476dd","expressionId":"x_ff4dbe293ef7d01d83d2","language":"ja","text":"=fire department","source":"EJDict"},{"id":"m_2debc47743e1bef6f068","expressionId":"x_44ff16abbe5fc6a3490a","language":"ja","text":"(性質・習慣などにより)…しがちである,しやすい;《話》…しそうな,たぶん…する","source":"EJDict"},{"id":"m_6a235e07444b1ad18dc5","expressionId":"x_96eaff298ca28af1cb37","language":"ja","text":"警官","source":"EJDict"},{"id":"m_134efbde92a37ff6e53a","expressionId":"x_69e0b709f65619bcbc08","language":"ja","text":"『水泳プール』","source":"EJDict"},{"id":"m_0d5a7c9774a6c17c3b2f","expressionId":"x_92729e626f82bf9af30c","language":"ja","text":"『天気予報』","source":"EJDict"}]